&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI company, is seeking a dynamic &lt;strong&gt;Federal Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;. As an integral part of our growth strategy, you will play a key role in growing our presence within &lt;strong&gt;the Department of Commerce&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;customer accounts. This is an opportunity for those who are passionate about empowering companies through ground breaking AI powered search technology and analytics, enabling them to unlock the full potential of their data.&lt;/p&gt;
