&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Mid-Market Account Executive dedicated to 100% net-new revenue generation. In this role, you will own the full sales cycle—from cold outreach to close—focused entirely on acquiring new logos in an assigned territory. If you excel at navigating new organizations and demonstrating the value of advanced search technology to stakeholders, this is your opportunity to drive our next phase of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
