&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a dynamic Revenue Manager who is eager to collaborate and support significant growth at a global, publicly traded software company! Based in India, this position will report directly to the Senior Revenue Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you well versed in revenue accounting? Does being a critical member of a cross-functional team that is continuously problem solving sound exhilarating and ambitious? Do you want to be a key contributor in a fast-paced, rapidly growing technology company?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If so, we would love to hear from you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting with revenue contract review under ASC 606 guidance. Determining appropriate Revenue recognition for signed contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting cross-functional partners (Sales, Order Ops, CBO, FP&amp;amp;A, Platform Billing, etc.) by resolving SFDC cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting or reviewing revenue memos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the Revenue close process with a dedicated focus on cloud revenue accounting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and reviewing UAT testing to drive system and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing or reviewing revenue reconciliations, analysis and managing complex large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating and managing auditing requests, including addressing auditor inquiries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and delivering internal training to enhance organizational revenue knowledge sharing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finding opportunities to improve existing processes and controls and minimize risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completing ad hoc projects and supporting a variety of critical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of overall experience in revenue with an understanding of ASC 606, including software and SaaS related principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Big 4 and/or publicly traded technology company experience (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RevPro, NetSuite and Salesforce experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Workspace applications including Google BigQuery, Gemini, Gmail, Google-Sheets, Google-Docs, and NoteBookLM preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sigma or comparable Front End BI Tool experience desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude or comparable AI tool experience desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortability working independently in a distributed, dynamic, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication (written and verbal) and social skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, including the capacity to balance multiple competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A talent for simplifying and summarizing sophisticated information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Composure in evolving and ambitious circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive and proactive demeanor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong desire for learning, growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commitment to deadlines and being detail oriented.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent team player and a fast learner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
