&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4duvr-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In this role as a Proposal Analyst, you will serve as a foundational pillar within the Global Proposal Management Team (PMT), taking ownership of project setup, intake organization, and initial content development. You will act as the primary point of contact for sales screening and triage by evaluating incoming RFx requests, assessing vendor requirements, and aligning initial strategy to ensure project readiness. Streamlining intake workflows and supporting proposal drafting allows you to establish the framework necessary for Proposal Managers and senior &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r12:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4duvr-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4duvr-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; to execute high-stakes RFx responses smoothly. Centralizing product qualification and channel alignment directly supports scaling our sales operations to meet growing business demands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
