&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f19l9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r18:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f19l9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f19l9-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; interpersonal and coaching skills to collaborate across cross-functional teams, align external partners, and enable sales professionals on process standards. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
