&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;crs6p-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;crs6p-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience selling to Engineering organizations made up of Developers and architects with buyers that are making build vs buy decisions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:rl8:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;crs6p-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;crs6p-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; of the SDLC, Buying cycle of these types of buyers, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
