vability solutions (being a former practitioner is a plus) with a nuanced &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1o:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8hmpb-9-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8hmpb-10-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; of the Observability market technologies and competitive dynamics. Additionally, you should be adept at the creative aspects of positioning technology through messaging and narratives that are compelling, authentic, and differentiated!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
